  "items": [
    {
      "type": "research",
      "title": "JointReorder显式对齐关节与动作次序",
      "source": "huggingface/lerobot",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T18:59:06Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot/commit/b13b952556c597d1e0849cadb6b6e7496bc5a2f3",
      "commitSha": "b13b952556c597d1e0849cadb6b6e7496bc5a2f3",
      "signals": [
        "JointReorderProcessorStep对指定observation key及tensor/array action执行x[...,indices]；transform_features同步输出末轴长度。",
        "已读重排、feature shape与序列化三类测试；未执行上游测试。不会自动变换单位、符号或控制器含义。"
      ],
      "decision": "已加入11月26日代码课延伸：行为距离计算前必须统一关节身份与顺序，不改历史课。"
    },
    {
      "type": "research",
      "title": "终止观测复制并在下一步清除",
      "source": "isaac-sim/IsaacLab",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T16:59:14Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLab/commit/fe51ca8be638e8ab196f0543054891a3df5fc65a",
      "commitSha": "fe51ca8be638e8ab196f0543054891a3df5fc65a",
      "signals": [
        "DirectRL/MARL在reset前tree_map(torch.clone)拥有final_obs，step/reset清除旧final_obs；AMP保留其他extras。",
        "已读manager/direct/marl参数化CPU桩测试，验证reset不覆盖终止值、后续step不残留且user/log仍在；未跑上游。"
      ],
      "decision": "11月29日offline-to-online和12月20日回归复查；不把旧terminal污染误判成策略退步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "research",
      "title": "隐式PD增加按物理步延迟的命令通道",
      "source": "isaac-sim/IsaacLab",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T21:59:04Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLab/commit/8f7a7851fc2ddf812611a3bf06575bd4d22067fc",
      "commitSha": "8f7a7851fc2ddf812611a3bf06575bd4d22067fc",
      "signals": [
        "DelayedImplicitActuator共享_DelayedActuator历史：reset按环境采样一个lag，位置/速度/前馈力矩共用，增益与关节反馈保持当前。",
        "文档明确计physics steps含decimation、启动使用最老命令、局部reset只清对应历史；PhysX/OVPhysX/Newton路径条件，非真机测量。"
      ],
      "decision": "毕业项目延迟辨识与仿真回归选读；不能把目标延迟当成传感器反馈延迟，不改纲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "research",
      "title": "PPISP转为tensor processor并显式要求中性曝光",
      "source": "isaac-sim/IsaacLab",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T22:18:17Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLab/commit/15077020d65c4c02d4b1b57fc66fdddb2c7256f9",
      "commitSha": "15077020d65c4c02d4b1b57fc66fdddb2c7256f9",
      "signals": [
        "PpispProcessor从rgb_hdr经ISP到持久RGBA/RGB view；Isaac RTX/OVRTX需ExposureCfg(mode=neutral)，否则报错，不静默改其他color outputs。",
        "已读prepare_camera、camera文档与neutral schema/三renderer/persistent view测试；Newton Warp/OptiX无曝光无需此设置，发现无PPISP属性则移除并警告；未GPU复测。"
      ],
      "decision": "后续RAW/RGB消融、12月20日传感回归：防止双重曝光混淆；同既有HDR链的实质续更，不宣称新策略效果。"
    }
  ],
